# Code owners. With "Require review from Code Owners" on main, every PR needs
# the owner's approval. GitHub reads this file from a PR's base branch, so it
# applies once it is on main. Confirm the handle before the foundations PR
# merges (docs/SETUP_CHECKLIST.md, step 3).
#
# Later lines win. The default owner is listed first; the paths below are the
# mandatory line-by-line review list of re-plan §3.3. They name the same owner
# today on purpose: when more people get access, these paths must stay with the
# CTO even if the default changes.

# Default owner
*                                         @imtgsat

# Mandatory line-by-line CTO review (re-plan §3.3)
# Gateway: signing, permits, operation registry, any code that writes to IWS, and its
# tests (the guard's and the signer's red-team cases)
/src/airtimesat_platform/gateway/         @imtgsat
/tests/gateway/                           @imtgsat
# Masker: the masking engine for SITEST data. Its tests, the leak tests and the
# masked fixtures live outside the package, so they are matched by name (re-plan §3.4).
/src/airtimesat_platform/masker/          @imtgsat
**/*mask*                                 @imtgsat
**/*leak*                                 @imtgsat
# Recorder (it writes to IWS), its tests, and the recording plans (every plan is a
# live-call request the CTO runs; design s2-recorder-masker §7.3)
/src/airtimesat_platform/recorder/        @imtgsat
/tests/recorder/                          @imtgsat
/recording-plans/                         @imtgsat
# Runbooks: they steer the CTO's manual IWS calls (DEACTIVE, the Beta-name check)
/docs/runbooks/                           @imtgsat
# Secrets handling, wherever it lives
/src/airtimesat_platform/common/secrets*  @imtgsat
**/*secret*                               @imtgsat
# Terraform and IAM policies
/infra/                                   @imtgsat
**/*iam*                                  @imtgsat
# GitHub OIDC trust policy
**/*oidc*                                 @imtgsat
# CI workflows, CODEOWNERS, Dependabot, PR template
/.github/                                 @imtgsat
# Container images
Dockerfile*                               @imtgsat
# Agent rules
/CLAUDE.md                                @imtgsat
# Dependencies and tool configuration, including the import-linter contracts ([tool.importlinter])
/pyproject.toml                           @imtgsat
/uv.lock                                  @imtgsat

# Gate configuration: a change here can weaken a CI gate
/Makefile                                 @imtgsat
/licensing/                               @imtgsat
/scripts/licence_gate.py                  @imtgsat
/.gitleaks.toml                           @imtgsat
/.gitignore                               @imtgsat
/.pre-commit-config.yaml                  @imtgsat
/tests/test_import_contracts.py           @imtgsat
/SECURITY.md                              @imtgsat
